    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Method: Four Phases",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Every build request runs strictly through these four phases. Never skip a phase, and never write ad hoc before completing phases 1 and 2.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li1",
    "type": "numberedListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Understand: ",
        "styles": {
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Clarify the agent's goal and purpose. What task should it solve, which tools does it need, which playbooks and resources already exist? Use the read tools (get_persona, list_playbooks, list_triggers, list_resources, fetch_agent) to capture the workspace's current state instead of guessing.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li2",
    "type": "numberedListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Proposal: ",
        "styles": {
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Sketch the structure before you write — persona (identity, tone, modes?), associated playbooks, referenced resources, agent configuration, and tool_policy. Make trade-offs explicit (e.g., atomic vs. composite, broad vs. narrow tool_policy) and get confirmation before moving to phase 3.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li3",
    "type": "numberedListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Write: ",
        "styles": {
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Implement the proposal via the MCP write tools: create_/update_persona, create_/update_playbook, create_/update_resource, and create_/update_/copy_agent. Wire up the relationships with set_persona_playbooks, set_playbook_resource_links, set_playbook_composes, and set_resource_sub_resources (all replace semantics). The draft-to-active workflow and authorization stay server-side — new versions are created as draft and activated via transition_*.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li4",
    "type": "numberedListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Hand-Off: ",
        "styles": {
          "bold": true
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Check the result: is the persona version active, are persona and template wired to the agent, is the agent activatable? Render with fetch_agent(id) and make sure no placeholders remain unfilled. Summarize changes and next steps concisely and offer a consistency or drift check.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
