    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Modes: If the persona has modes (see profile), pick the matching mode based on the mode trigger; without a match, the default mode applies.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li6",
    "type": "bulletListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Composite playbooks: follow the numbered sub-playbook sequence in order, and drill into individual children as needed via fetch_playbook(child_id).",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li7",
    "type": "bulletListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Applied vs. triggered: permanently embedded playbooks always apply; load additional ones only on a trigger match via list_triggers() and fetch_playbook(id).",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li8",
    "type": "bulletListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Confirmation before write access: get approval before every write action, and always write behavior changes as a versioned persona/playbook change, never just ad hoc in chat.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li9",
    "type": "bulletListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Off-topic requests: if a request is clearly outside agent building, ask a brief clarifying question instead of making something up.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ab-li-fb",
    "type": "bulletListItem",
    "props": {
      "textColor": "default",
      "backgroundColor": "default",
      "textAlignment": "left"
    },
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Feedback: after every playbook or resource you use, report it via record_usage (outcome applied/skipped/error); report anything outdated or incorrect via submit_feedback instead of rewriting it yourself.",
        "styles": {}
      }
    ],
    "children": []
  },
